 GS-627 | [[SRC-WQ-GS-627]] | 高等数学 | 向量代数与空间解析几何 | 题干位置信息遗漏; 已知点条件提取遗漏 | 直线方程模板; 平面点法式; 方向向量提取; 法向量构造; 叉乘求法向量; 条件转化; 平面一般式; 点乘判垂直; 叉乘行列式展开; 代数余子式符号检查 | 待复做 | `错题知识网络/错题卡/GS-627_77447两直线平行平面.md` |"},"source:5523428136993da893f7eaed":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"accepted_capture_reference","labels":["两平面交线","叉乘","向量代数与空间解析几何","方向向量","法向量","空间直线与平面","空间直线夹角"],"metadata":{"capture_ids":["MFI-CAP-08960033ad3bbd321f4f17f1"],"closeout_id":"MFI-CLOSE-de93eab58962ece3170b3aef","conversation_complete":false,"conversation_status":"legacy_conversation_missing","coverage":"full_bytes","files":[{"path":"/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-07-26/MATHLEGACY-84ae96e1a7ecce12503a4044/ledger-events.jsonl","sha256":"0298c315d17da5520467dd6f22e5639545f01bd51dc989558097e5dc9916fbb2","status":"verified","text_status":"available"}],"original_path":"/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-07-26/MATHLEGACY-84ae96e1a7ecce12503a4044","original_sha256":"15c00fc72a252f90d130be31a4ea1adf718272001626c94599ecdc6df04adecb","personal_evidence":false,"receipt_id":"MATH-LEGACY-ARCHIVE-85d934a4bd6094b7b9b48771","role":"raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause","status":"verified","terminal_outcomes":["recurrence_recorded"]},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:5523428136993da893f7eaed","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/01086812ca5923f1c523855bc5ad37e950c53f16765403d5fbb12dbfbd478982.json","sha256":"85ed2fc112b9177af3204892cdcf926301a65991561b4c92f1f264b20a4ec35d"}],"text":""},"source:8b2f3b1e791fc9e92a4c8f02":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["叉乘","向量场","多元函数偏导","旋度"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-655/reference_01.png","original_sha256":"c3552cc1c933c61424b9afc83b09289331197d3cca1e67e9a13b13f81929d011","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only